('476', '1', 'faq_1_q', 'text', 'What pharmaceutical packaging products does Prince Art Packages manufacture?', '197'),
('477', '1', 'faq_1_a', 'text', 'We manufacture specialized secondary packaging including paperboard Printed Cartons (reverse tuck, crash lock), ultra-thin 27gsm–60gsm patient prescribing information leaflets, miniature multi-folded outserts, self-adhesive roll labels, tamper-evident packaging, and ColdSeal blister wallets.', '198'),
('478', '1', 'faq_2_q', 'text', 'Does Prince Art Packages manufacture custom pharmaceutical cartons?', '199'),
('479', '1', 'faq_2_a', 'text', 'Yes. We engineer bespoke paperboard cartons customized to your product dimensions (blister packs, vials, bottles, ampoules) with custom grammage (230gsm–400gsm), high-precision die-cutting, embossing, Braille text, and specialty barrier finishes.', '200'),
('480', '1', 'faq_3_q', 'text', 'Are your manufacturing facilities cGMP compliant?', '201'),
('481', '1', 'faq_3_a', 'text', 'Yes. Both Unit 1 and Unit 2 in Korangi Creek Industrial Park operate under strict cGMP protocols, featuring segregated production lines, physical line clearance procedures, positive air pressure, and zero cross-contamination safeguards.', '202'),
('482', '1', 'faq_4_q', 'text', 'What certifications does Prince Art Packages have?', '203'),
('483', '1', 'faq_4_a', 'text', 'We hold ISO 9001:2015 Quality Management System Certification (Cert No: KQ.2025.5393) and FSC Chain of Custody Certification (FSC-C222205 / FSC-STD-40-004), fully aligned with WHO-GMP manufacturing and auditing standards.', '204'),
('484', '1', 'faq_5_q', 'text', 'Do you manufacture pharmaceutical leaflets and inserts?', '205'),
('485', '1', 'faq_5_a', 'text', 'Yes. We print ultra-thin 27gsm to 60gsm prescribing information inserts and miniature outserts on high-speed specialized folding equipment equipped with 100% electronic optical scanning to prevent line mix-ups.', '206'),
('486', '1', 'faq_6_q', 'text', 'Do you manufacture printed pharmaceutical labels?', '207'),
('487', '1', 'faq_6_a', 'text', 'Yes. We produce high-density self-adhesive roll labels for ampoules, vials, and bottles, printed on pharma-grade substrates with durable adhesives, 2D DataMatrix serialization, and scratch-resistant varnishes.', '208'),
('488', '1', 'faq_7_q', 'text', 'Do you provide tamper-evident packaging?', '209'),
('489', '1', 'faq_7_a', 'text', 'Yes. We engineer integrated tamper-evident cartons (perforated tear strips, locking security tucks) and destructible tamper-evident security labels that deliver immediate visual evidence of tampering.', '210'),
('490', '1', 'faq_8_q', 'text', 'Do you offer anti-counterfeit pharmaceutical packaging?', '211'),
('491', '1', 'faq_8_a', 'text', 'Yes. We offer proprietary optical security solutions including our 3D-Engravix™ security feature, covert micro-text, serialized 2D barcodes, guilloche patterns, and security inks to protect pharmaceutical brands from counterfeiting.', '212'),
('492', '1', 'faq_9_q', 'text', 'What information is required to request a quotation?', '213'),
('493', '1', 'faq_9_a', 'text', 'To receive an accurate quotation, please provide the packaging format (carton, leaflet, label), dimensions (L × W × H), paperboard/paper GSM, color specifications (CMYK/Pantone), special finishing requirements, and estimated order quantities.', '214'),
('494', '1', 'faq_10_q', 'text', 'Where is Prince Art Packages located?', '215'),
('495', '1', 'faq_10_a', 'text', 'Our corporate offices and two advanced production plants are located at WH-17-A8, ST-1, Sector 38 and Plot 239, Korangi Creek Industrial Park, Karachi, Pakistan.', '216'),
('496', '1', 'faq_11_q', 'text', 'Do you supply pharmaceutical packaging to international markets?', '217'),
('497', '1', 'faq_11_a', 'text', 'Yes. In addition to supplying leading pharmaceutical formulation plants across Pakistan, we export audit-compliant secondary packaging to regulated healthcare clients in international markets.', '218'),
('498', '6', 'hero_eyebrow', 'text', 'PHARMACEUTICAL SECONDARY PACKAGING CATALOG', '5'),
('499', '6', 'hero_title', 'text', 'Engineered Secondary Packaging Solutions for Regulated Pharma', '6'),
('500', '6', 'hero_intro', 'text', 'High-precision Printed Cartons, prescribing leaflets, self-adhesive roll labels, and protective partitions manufactured under ISO 9001:2015 and cGMP guidelines.', '7'),
('501', '6', 'sec_subtitle', 'text', 'MANUFACTURING PRODUCT RANGE', '10'),
('502', '6', 'sec_h2_title', 'text', 'Comprehensive Pharmaceutical Secondary Packaging Portfolio', '20'),
('503', '6', 'sec_h2_intro', 'text', 'Prince Art Packages manufactures a specialized range of secondary packaging tailored for pharmaceutical formulation plants, OTC healthcare brands, and medical device manufacturers. Every packaging format is precision-engineered for seamless operation on high-speed automated cartoning lines, blister sealers, and serialization barcode vision systems — ensuring zero defect rates, batch traceability, and full regulatory compliance.', '30'),
('504', '8', 'hero_eyebrow', 'text', 'REGULATORY ASSURANCE & AUDIT COMPLIANCE', '5'),
('505', '8', 'hero_title', 'text', 'Quality & Compliance at the Core of Our Operations', '6'),
('506', '8', 'hero_intro', 'text', 'Stringent cGMP protocols, ISO 9001:2015 certification, and FSC Chain of Custody standards ensuring zero-defect packaging for regulated healthcare markets.', '7'),
('507', '8', 'sec_subtitle', 'text', 'CERTIFICATIONS & LABORATORY ASSURANCE', '10'),
('508', '8', 'sec_h2_title', 'text', 'Certified Quality Management & In-House Laboratory Control', '20'),
('509', '8', 'sec_h2_intro', 'text', 'Pharmaceutical secondary packaging requires absolute precision, strict line clearance, and zero tolerance for artwork mix-ups. At Prince Art Packages, our manufacturing operations are governed by comprehensive Standard Operating Procedures (SOPs), validated cGMP segregation, spectrophotometric delta-E color controls, and accredited ISO 9001:2015 and FSC certifications. Our dedicated in-house Quality Control Laboratory (OurLAB) verifies substrate caliper, ink rub-resistance, barcode readability, and moisture resistance across every production run.', '30'),
('510', '4', 'hero_eyebrow', 'text', 'PROPRIETARY PACKAGING TECHNOLOGIES', '5'),
('511', '4', 'hero_title', 'text', 'Advanced Packaging Innovations & Anti-Counterfeiting Security', '6'),
('512', '4', 'hero_intro', 'text', 'Pioneering eco-friendly ColdSeal blister wallets and proprietary 3D-ENGRAVIX™ optical security structures for pharmaceutical patient safety and brand authentication.', '7'),
('513', '4', 'sec_subtitle', 'text', 'INNOVATION & BRAND PROTECTION', '10'),
('514', '4', 'sec_h2_title', 'text', 'Next-Generation Packaging Engineering for Patient Safety', '20'),
('515', '4', 'sec_h2_intro', 'text', 'As pharmaceutical markets face rising counterfeit threats and increasing environmental sustainability requirements, Prince Art Packages invests heavily in proprietary packaging engineering. From heat-free ColdSeal Blister Wallets that preserve temperature-sensitive pharmaceuticals while reducing plastic usage by up to 50%, to our patented 3D-ENGRAVIX™ micro-structured optical security cartons that provide instant ambient-light authentication without requiring electronic scanners, our innovations deliver robust supply chain integrity.', '30'),
('516', '11', 'hero_eyebrow', 'text', 'TECHNICAL INSIGHTS & REGULATORY UPDATES', '5'),
('517', '11', 'hero_title', 'text', 'Pharmaceutical Packaging Insights & Technical Knowledge', '6'),
('518', '11', 'hero_intro', 'text', 'Expert analysis, compliance guides, material selection insights, and engineering updates from Prince Art Packages technical desk.', '7'),
('519', '11', 'sec_subtitle', 'text', 'KNOWLEDGE & INDUSTRY ARTICLES', '10'),
('520', '11', 'sec_h2_title', 'text', 'Latest Technical Articles & Industry Guidelines', '20'),
('521', '11', 'sec_h2_intro', 'text', 'Stay informed on regulatory changes, pharmaceutical secondary packaging best practices, anti-counterfeit advancements, and sustainable packaging materials. Authored by our packaging engineers and quality assurance specialists, our publications provide practical technical insights for pharmaceutical production managers, regulatory affairs leads, and procurement teams.', '30'),
('522', '9', 'hero_eyebrow', 'text', 'TARGET PHARMACEUTICAL SECTORS', '5'),
('523', '9', 'hero_title', 'text', 'Specialized Packaging Solutions for Regulated Healthcare Industries', '6'),
('524', '9', 'hero_intro', 'text', 'Tailored secondary packaging engineered specifically for commercial pharmaceuticals, consumer healthcare & OTC products, and sterile biologics & medical devices.', '7'),
('525', '9', 'sec_subtitle', 'text', 'TARGET SECTORS & FORMULATION TYPES', '10'),
('526', '9', 'sec_h2_title', 'text', 'Purpose-Built Packaging for Diverse Healthcare Demands', '20'),
('527', '9', 'sec_h2_intro', 'text', 'Every healthcare sector possesses distinct regulatory standards, shelf-life conditions, and machine packing requirements. Prince Art Packages provides purpose-engineered paperboard packaging, patient information leaflets, and security labels adapted to the specific operational constraints of pharmaceutical tablet/capsule blister packing, liquid syrup bottling, ampoule/vial cartoning, and cold-chain biologics storage.', '30'),
('528', '14', 'hero_eyebrow', 'text', 'PROVEN MANUFACTURING RESULTS', '5'),
('529', '14', 'hero_title', 'text', 'Proven Manufacturing Results & Audit Performance Metrics', '6'),
('530', '14', 'hero_intro', 'text', 'Discover how our precision packaging engineering delivers 99.98% defect-free output, zero cartoning line jams, and 100% regulatory audit compliance.', '7'),
('531', '14', 'sec_subtitle', 'text', 'AUDIT PERFORMANCE & CLIENT METRICS', '10'),
('532', '14', 'sec_h2_title', 'text', 'Real-World Engineering Solutions & Zero-Defect Delivery', '20'),
('533', '14', 'sec_h2_intro', 'text', 'Modern pharmaceutical packaging requires strict adherence to technical tolerances and rigorous cGMP line clearance. Explore how Prince Art Packages collaborates with leading pharmaceutical manufacturers to solve high-speed cartoning line jams, eliminate leaflet mix-ups with automated sensor vision systems, and pass comprehensive multinational quality audits.', '30'),
('534', '2', 'pillar_7_title', 'text', 'Dedicated Technical Team', '140'),
('535', '2', 'pillar_7_desc', 'text', 'Staffed by experienced prepress designers, print production technologists, quality assurance auditors, and packaging engineers dedicated to meeting client specifications.', '145'),
('536', '2', 'pillar_8_title', 'text', 'Customer-Centric Partnership', '150'),
('537', '2', 'pillar_8_desc', 'text', 'We provide collaborative packaging design assistance, pilot batch sampling, rapid turnaround times, and flexible production scheduling to support our clients commercial launches.', '155'),
('538', '6', 'faq_subtitle', 'text', 'Frequently Asked Questions', '200'),
('539', '6', 'faq_title', 'text', 'Product & Manufacturing FAQs', '205'),
('540', '6', 'faq_intro', 'text', 'Common technical questions regarding our pharmaceutical secondary packaging specifications, substrates, customization capabilities, machine compatibility, and minimum order requirements.', '210'),
('541', '6', 'faq_1_q', 'text', 'What pharmaceutical secondary packaging products does Prince Art Packages manufacture?', '220'),
('542', '6', 'faq_1_a', '', 'We manufacture a specialized range of regulated secondary packaging including high-precision Printed Cartons (RTE, STE, auto-lock crash bottom), Leaf-Inserts (prescribing leaflets and miniature outserts down to 27 GSM), self-adhesive Printed Labels, Honeycomb Separators for glass ampoules and vials, Dose-Adherence Pill-Folders, Tamper-Evident Cartons & Security Seals (EN 16679 compliant), 3D-ENGRAVIX™ Optical Anti-Counterfeit Cartons, and eco-friendly ColdSeal Blister Wallets.', '225'),
('543', '6', 'faq_2_q', 'text', 'Can you customize carton dimensions, dielines, and board calipers for our specific packaging machines?', '230'),
('544', '6', 'faq_2_a', '', 'Yes, absolutely. Our in-house structural design desk develops bespoke CAD dielines, electronic PDF proofs, and physical unprinted or printed sample mock-ups tailored to your exact primary container dimensions and automated cartoning lines (such as Bosch, Uhlmann, IMA, Marchesini, and Romaco).', '235'),
('545', '6', 'faq_3_q', 'text', 'What paperboard substrates and grammages are available for Printed Cartons?', '240'),
('546', '6', 'faq_3_a', '', 'We work with certified virgin Folding Box Board (FBB / GC1 and GC2), Solid Bleached Sulfate (SBS), and pharma-grade duplex boxboards ranging from 230 GSM to 450 GSM (thickness: 350 to 650 microns). All raw materials are sourced from FSC-certified and food/pharma-approved global mills.', '245'),
('547', '6', 'faq_4_q', 'text', 'How do you prevent product mix-ups on high-density Leaf-Inserts and miniature outserts?', '250'),
('548', '6', 'faq_4_a', '', 'Every leaflet folding line is equipped with 100% inline optical Pharma-Code and 2D barcode vision inspection scanners. Any unverified or mismatched leaflet is instantly rejected by high-speed pneumatic gates, ensuring zero mix-ups throughout production.', '255'),
('549', '6', 'faq_5_q', 'text', 'Are your packaging cartons and labels compatible with serialization (2D DataMatrix) requirements?', '260'),
('550', '6', 'faq_5_a', '', 'Yes. Our printed cartons and labels are formulated with high-contrast, non-smear aqueous top-coatings optimized for continuous inkjet (CIJ), thermal transfer (TTO), and inline laser serialization coding. Furthermore, our tamper-evident carton designs comply with EN 16679:2014 and EU Directive 2011/62/EU.', '265'),
('551', '6', 'faq_6_q', 'text', 'Do you provide in-line Braille embossing on pharmaceutical cartons?', '265'),
('552', '6', 'faq_6_a', '', 'Yes. We provide certified in-line Braille dot embossing conforming to the Marburg Medium standard (European Directive 2004/27/EC), with dot height and spacing verified via optical inspection gauges to guarantee legibility and disability compliance.', '270'),
('553', '6', 'faq_7_q', 'text', 'What are your standard production lead times and minimum order quantities (MOQ)?', '275'),
('554', '6', 'faq_7_a', '', 'Standard production lead times typically range from 7 to 14 business days after final artwork sign-off and batch clearance. We offer flexible MOQ tiers accommodating pilot formulation batches, clinical trial runs, and high-volume commercial production runs.', '280'),
('555', '6', 'faq_8_q', 'text', 'How can our QA or procurement team request physical samples or a formal technical quotation?', '285'),
('556', '6', 'faq_8_a', '', 'You can request physical sample kits, unprinted structural mock-ups, or a formal technical quotation directly through any product page on our website, or by contacting our Technical Sales Desk at +92 21-38893400-3 / sales@princeartpackages.com.', '290'),
('557', '8', 'commit_subtitle', 'text', 'PHARMACEUTICAL QUALITY COMMITMENT', '20'),
('558', '8', 'commit_title', 'text', 'Uncompromising Quality Standards for Patient Safety', '25'),
('559', '8', 'commit_intro', 'text', 'In pharmaceutical secondary packaging, quality is not merely an inspection checkpoint—it is the foundational pillar of patient safety and brand protection. Prince Art Packages operates under a total quality management philosophy where every printed carton, prescribing leaflet, and security label is engineered to prevent line stoppages, eliminate artwork mix-ups, and withstand rigorous regulatory audits.', '30'),
('560', '8', 'commit_pillar_1_title', 'text', 'Zero Error Tolerance', '35'),
('561', '8', 'commit_pillar_1_desc', 'text', 'Rigorous SOPs and continuous line monitoring ensure zero deviation from approved technical specifications.', '40'),
('562', '8', 'commit_pillar_2_title', 'text', '100% Batch Traceability', '45'),
('563', '8', 'commit_pillar_2_desc', 'text', 'Full end-to-end documentation from incoming raw paperboard reels to finished carton dispatch with assigned batch codes.', '50'),
('564', '8', 'commit_pillar_3_title', 'text', 'Independent QA Oversight', '55'),
('565', '8', 'commit_pillar_3_desc', 'text', 'Our Quality Assurance department operates with full autonomous stop-production authority across both manufacturing plants.', '60'),
('566', '8', 'commit_pillar_4_title', 'text', 'Continuous Reinvestment', '65'),
('567', '8', 'commit_pillar_4_desc', 'text', 'Ongoing capital investments in calibrated optical testing instruments, inline sensor inspection, and automated tooling.', '70'),
('568', '8', 'cert_hub_subtitle', 'text', 'GLOBAL ACCREDITATIONS', '75'),
('569', '8', 'cert_hub_title', 'text', 'Internationally Verified Certifications & Standards', '80'),
('570', '8', 'cert_hub_intro', 'text', 'Our dual manufacturing facilities in Korangi Creek Industrial Park, Karachi, operate in full compliance with internationally recognized quality and environmental stewardship frameworks.', '85'),
('571', '8', 'cgmp_subtitle', 'text', 'MANUFACTURING DISCIPLINE', '90'),
('572', '8', 'cgmp_title', 'text', 'cGMP Compliance & Zero-Mixup Packaging Controls', '95'),
('573', '8', 'cgmp_intro', 'text', 'Current Good Manufacturing Practices (cGMP) govern every step of our printing, folding, gluing, and converting workflows. Designed specifically for pharmaceutical clients, our facility protocols eliminate cross-contamination and ensure audit-ready consistency.', '100'),
('574', '8', 'cgmp_1_title', 'text', 'Formal Line Clearance Protocols', '105'),
('575', '8', 'cgmp_1_desc', 'text', 'Documented multi-point physical and digital line clearance before and after every production run to ensure no leftover material from previous batches.', '110'),
('576', '8', 'cgmp_2_title', 'text', '100% Optical Barcode & Pharma-Code Verification', '115'),
('577', '8', 'cgmp_2_desc', 'text', 'High-speed sensor cameras on folder-gluers and leaflet folding lines verify 100% of 2D DataMatrix and miniature barcodes with automated pneumatic rejection.', '120'),
('578', '8', 'cgmp_3_title', 'text', 'Controlled Environmental Conditions', '125'),
('579', '8', 'cgmp_3_desc', 'text', 'Temperature and humidity-regulated converting halls protect paperboard dimensional stability and prevent moisture warping.', '130'),
('580', '8', 'cgmp_4_title', 'text', 'Complete Batch Production Records (BPR)', '135'),
('581', '8', 'cgmp_4_desc', 'text', 'Every batch is accompanied by comprehensive Batch Manufacturing Records (BMR) detailing operators, machine parameters, ink lot numbers, and QC signatures.', '140'),
('582', '8', 'iso_desc', 'text', 'Our certified Quality Management System enforces structured risk assessment, calibrated measurement tracking, supplier audits, and systematic root-cause corrective actions (CAPA).', '170'),
('583', '8', 'fsc_desc', 'text', 'Guarantees that all virgin boxboards and lightweight leaflet papers are sourced from responsibly managed forests adhering to strict environmental, social, and economic sustainability standards.', '200'),
('584', '8', 'mat_subtitle', 'text', 'RAW MATERIAL QUALITY ASSURANCE', '205'),
('585', '8', 'mat_title', 'text', 'Incoming Material Inspection & Laboratory Testing (OurLAB)', '210'),
('586', '8', 'mat_intro', 'text', 'Zero-defect packaging starts with flawless raw materials. Every incoming shipment of paperboard, inks, varnishes, foils, and adhesives undergoes rigorous quarantine and laboratory verification prior to release into production.', '215'),
('587', '8', 'mat_1_title', 'text', 'GSM & Caliper Micrometer Verification', '220'),
('588', '8', 'mat_1_desc', 'text', 'Digital micrometer gauges and precision analytical balances verify paperboard thickness (microns) and substance (GSM) within ±2% tolerances.', '225'),
('589', '8', 'mat_2_title', 'text', 'Moisture Content & Cobb Sizing Analysis', '230'),
('590', '8', 'mat_2_desc', 'text', 'Electronic moisture analyzers and Cobb sizing testers measure board water absorption capacity to prevent carton curling and delamination.', '235'),
('591', '8', 'mat_3_title', 'text', 'Spectrophotometric Ink & Delta-E Tolerance', '240'),
('592', '8', 'mat_3_desc', 'text', 'Low-migration vegetable oil-based inks are calibrated with digital spectrophotometers to maintain Delta-E color variance under 1.5 across production.', '245'),
('593', '8', 'mat_4_title', 'text', 'Adhesive Tack, Viscosity & Fiber-Tear Testing', '250'),
('594', '8', 'mat_4_desc', 'text', 'Medical-grade adhesives and hot-melts are tested for bonding strength and guaranteed fiber tear under ambient, refrigerated, and deep-freeze temperatures.', '255'),
('595', '8', 'faq_subtitle', 'text', 'Frequently Asked Questions', '260'),
('596', '8', 'faq_title', 'text', 'Quality, Compliance & Audit FAQs', '265'),
('597', '8', 'faq_intro', 'text', 'Explore detailed answers regarding our pharmaceutical packaging audit procedures, Certificate of Analysis (CoA) dispatch, line clearance verification, and laboratory testing protocols.', '270'),
('598', '8', 'faq_1_q', 'text', 'Can our Quality Assurance and Regulatory team conduct an on-site facility audit?', '275'),
('599', '8', 'faq_1_a', '', 'Yes, absolutely. We regularly host scheduled facility audits for multinational pharmaceutical manufacturers, regulatory authorities, and independent inspection bodies. We provide full access to our SOPs, equipment validation documentation, calibration logs, and cGMP production floors in Korangi Creek, Karachi.', '280'),
('600', '8', 'faq_2_q', 'text', 'Do you provide a Certificate of Analysis (CoA) with every delivered batch?', '285'),
('601', '8', 'faq_2_a', '', 'Yes. Every dispatched shipment is accompanied by a formal Certificate of Analysis (CoA) and Certificate of Conformance (CoC) signed by our QA Manager, detailing substrate GSM, caliper, moisture levels, ink batch numbers, barcode scan grades, and line clearance verification.', '290'),
('602', '8', 'faq_3_q', 'text', 'How is line clearance managed between different customer packaging runs?', '295'),
('603', '8', 'faq_3_a', '', 'We enforce strict 3-tier cGMP line clearance SOPs. Before any new job begins, the previous job materials, plates, cutting dies, waste, and documentation are completely cleared from the packaging cell. Line clearance is physically inspected and dual-signed by the Line Incharge and the QA Inspector before machine startup.', '300'),
('604', '8', 'faq_4_q', 'text', 'What spectrophotometric color tolerances (Delta-E) do you guarantee?', '305'),
('605', '8', 'faq_4_a', '', 'Our offset presses operate with closed-loop inline spectrophotometry and densitometry calibrated to X-Rite Pantone digital color standards. We maintain Delta-E (ΔE) color variances under 1.5 to guarantee exact brand shade consistency across multiple batches over years of production.', '310'),
('606', '8', 'faq_5_q', 'text', 'How is Braille embossing verified on pharmaceutical cartons?', '315'),
('607', '8', 'faq_5_a', '', 'Braille embossing is applied in-line using precision CNC tooling compliant with the Marburg Medium standard (European Directive 2004/27/EC). Our QA laboratory verifies dot height (0.20 mm standard) and dot spacing across sampling sheets using calibrated optical depth micrometers.', '320'),
('608', '8', 'faq_6_q', 'text', 'What is your procedure for Corrective and Preventive Actions (CAPA)?', '325'),
('609', '8', 'faq_6_a', '', 'Under our ISO 9001:2015 QMS framework, any identified non-conformance initiates a structured CAPA investigation utilizing 5-Why root-cause analysis and Ishikawa fishbone diagrams. Corrective actions are implemented, documented, and audited for long-term effectiveness within 14 business days.', '330'),
('610', '8', 'cta_title', 'text', 'Schedule a Facility Audit or Request Quality Manual', '335'),
('611', '8', 'cta_desc', 'text', 'Speak directly with our Quality Assurance Directorate to arrange an on-site audit, request technical compliance dossiers, or review our laboratory testing capabilities.', '340');
INSERT INTO `products` VALUES
('1', 'Printed Cartons', 'printed-cartons', 'Secondary Packaging', 'Reverse tuck, crash lock, tamper-evident, and child-resistant cartons printed on food & pharma-grade virgin board.', 'Reverse tuck, crash lock, tamper-evident, and child-resistant cartons printed on food & pharma-grade virgin board.', NULL, 'assets/images/prod_cartons.jpg', NULL, NULL, '1', '2026-08-29 02:58:37'),
('2', 'Leaf-Inserts', 'leaf-inserts', 'Patient Information', 'Ultra-thin 27gsm to 60gsm prescribing information inserts, cross-folded or miniature outserts for automated packaging lines.', 'Ultra-thin 27gsm to 60gsm prescribing information inserts, cross-folded or miniature outserts for automated packaging lines.', NULL, 'assets/images/prod_leaflets.jpg', NULL, NULL, '1', '2026-08-29 02:58:37'),
('3', 'Printed Labels', 'printed-labels', 'Container Labeling', 'Self-adhesive roll labels for vials, bottles, ampoules, and destructible tamper-evident security seals with 2D barcode serialization.', 'Self-adhesive roll labels for vials, bottles, ampoules, and destructible tamper-evident security seals with 2D barcode serialization.', NULL, 'assets/images/prod_labels.jpg', NULL, NULL, '1', '2026-08-29 02:58:37'),
('4', 'Honeycomb Separators', 'honeycomb-separators', 'Protective Partitions', 'Protective cardboard honeycomb dividers and grid partitions designed to safeguard glass ampoules and liquid vials.', 'Protective cardboard honeycomb dividers and grid partitions designed to safeguard glass ampoules and liquid vials.', NULL, 'assets/images/prod_honeycomb.jpg', NULL, NULL, '1', '2026-08-29 02:58:37'),
('5', 'Pill-Folders', 'pill-folders', 'Dose Adherence', 'Paperboard medicine packaging wallets with integrated dose-tracking calendar compartments engineered to support patient adherence.', 'Paperboard medicine packaging wallets with integrated dose-tracking calendar compartments engineered to support patient adherence.', NULL, 'assets/images/prod_pill_folders.jpg', NULL, NULL, '1', '2026-08-29 02:58:37'),
('6', 'Tamper Evident Cartons & Labels', 'tamper-evident', 'Security Seals', 'Destructible security seals and tamper-evident carton structures that provide immediate, irreversible visual evidence.', 'Destructible security seals and tamper-evident carton structures that provide immediate, irreversible visual evidence.', NULL, 'assets/images/prod_tamper_labels.jpg', NULL, NULL, '1', '2026-08-29 02:58:37'),
('7', '3D-ENGRAVIX™', '3d-engravix', 'Optical Anti-Counterfeit', 'Proprietary micro-structured optical security feature integrated directly onto printed cartons for instant visual authentication.', 'Proprietary micro-structured optical security feature integrated directly onto printed cartons for instant visual authentication.', NULL, 'assets/images/engravix.jpg', NULL, NULL, '1', '2026-08-29 02:58:37'),
('8', 'ColdSeal Blister Wallet', 'coldseal-blister-wallet', 'Pressure-Sealed Eco Packaging', 'Pressure-sealed (non-heat-sealed) paperboard blister packaging wallet encapsulating blister cards without heat.', 'Pressure-sealed (non-heat-sealed) paperboard blister packaging wallet encapsulating blister cards without heat.', NULL, 'assets/images/coldseal.jpg', NULL, NULL, '1', '2026-08-29 02:58:37');
INSERT INTO `blog_posts` VALUES
('1', 'ISO 9001:2015 & cGMP Compliance in Pharmaceutical Secondary Packaging', 'iso-9001-cgmp-compliance', 'An in-depth look at how stringent quality management systems and multi-point cGMP line clearance eliminate artwork mix-ups and ensure zero-defect packaging for regulated healthcare markets.', '<h2>The Critical Role of Quality Systems in Secondary Packaging</h2>\n<p>In pharmaceutical secondary packaging, quality is not merely an inspection checkpoint—it is the foundational pillar of patient safety and brand protection. Regulatory health authorities, including the US FDA, EMA, and local drug regulatory bodies, enforce strict Current Good Manufacturing Practices (cGMP) that require secondary packaging converters to maintain the same standards of cleanliness, segregation, and documentation as drug formulation facilities.</p>\n<h3>1. Formal 3-Tier Line Clearance Protocols</h3>\n<p>The primary risk during high-speed printing and converting is the potential for product mix-ups. At Prince Art Packages, every production cell adheres to a documented 3-tier line clearance Standard Operating Procedure (SOP):</p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Pre-Run Clearance:</strong> Complete physical evacuation of all plates, dies, carton waste, and documentation from the previous run.</li>\n  <li><strong>Dual Verification:</strong> Independent inspection and signature sign-off by both the Line Incharge and the Quality Assurance Inspector.</li>\n  <li><strong>Post-Run Reconciliation:</strong> Verification that total sheet inputs equal finished cartons plus documented process waste.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>2. Spectrophotometric Delta-E Color Control</h3>\n<p>Brand integrity and anti-counterfeiting rely heavily on color consistency. Utilizing closed-loop inline spectrophotometers calibrated to X-Rite Pantone digital libraries, we maintain Delta-E color variances under 1.5 across millions of printed cartons.</p>\n<h3>3. Complete Batch Manufacturing Records (BMR)</h3>\n<p>Every delivered shipment is accompanied by a formal Certificate of Analysis (CoA) and Batch Manufacturing Record detailing machine operators, substrate lot numbers, ink batch certificates, and optical scan logs.</p>', 'assets/images/prod_cartons.jpg', 'ISO 9001:2015 & cGMP Compliance in Pharma Packaging | Prince Art Packages', 'Comprehensive guide to cGMP line clearance, ISO 9001:2015 quality management, and batch traceability in pharmaceutical secondary packaging.', '1', '2026-02-15 10:00:00', '2026-08-25 04:03:48'),
('2', 'Anti-Counterfeiting Innovations: From Tamper-Evident Seals to 3D-Engravix™', 'anti-counterfeiting-innovations', 'Exploring multi-layered pharmaceutical security architectures combining EN 16679 tamper verification features with ambient-light 3D micro-optic carton authentication.', '<h2>Combating Falsified Medicines with Multi-Layered Packaging Security</h2>\n<p>The global trade in counterfeit pharmaceuticals poses an existential threat to patient health and pharmaceutical brand equity. Meeting the stringent mandates of the European Falsified Medicines Directive (Directive 2011/62/EU) and US DSCSA requires a multi-layered anti-tampering and authentication strategy.</p>\n<h3>1. EN 16679 Tamper Verification Features</h3>\n<p>European Standard EN 16679:2014 specifies verification features for medicinal packaging. We engineer high-bond virgin boxboards with precision-scored tear flaps and frangible security seals that guarantee irreversible visible carton damage upon first opening.</p>\n<h3>2. 3D-ENGRAVIX™ Proprietary Optical Security</h3>\n<p>While serial 2D DataMatrix barcodes verify supply chain nodes, doctors, pharmacists, and patients require instant, tool-free verification at point-of-dispense. 3D-ENGRAVIX™ is our proprietary optical security feature embedded directly onto printed paperboard cartons during inline converting:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Ambient Light Verification:</strong> 100% visual inspection under normal room light—zero smartphone apps or UV torches required.</li>\n  <li><strong>Kinetic Motion Effects:</strong> Dynamic spinning blade and multi-axis light motion illusions that cannot be replicated by commercial color scanners.</li>\n  <li><strong>Angle-Dependent Color Shift:</strong> Color-shifting seals that transform from deep violet to emerald green upon tilting.</li>\n</ul>', 'assets/images/engravix.jpg', 'Pharma Anti-Counterfeiting & 3D-Engravix™ | Prince Art Packages', 'Learn how EN 16679 tamper-evident cartons and 3D-ENGRAVIX optical security protect pharmaceutical supply chains against counterfeiting.', '1', '2026-02-18 11:30:00', '2026-08-25 04:03:48'),
('4', 'Optimizing High-Density Prescribing Leaflets (PIL) for Automated Inserters', 'optimizing-prescribing-leaflets-pil', 'How lightweight 27–60 GSM bible papers, cross-folding geometry, wafer tabs, and 100% optical Pharma-Code scanners prevent carton jamming on high-speed inserter carousels.', '<h2>Engineering Compact Patient Information Leaflets (PIL)</h2>\n<p>As global regulatory authorities mandate increasingly exhaustive clinical trial data, contraindications, and multi-language dosing guidelines, pharmaceutical brand owners face the challenge of inserting massive amounts of text into small secondary carton footprints.</p>\n<h3>1. Substrate Selection: 27 to 60 GSM High-Opacity Papers</h3>\n<p>Standard commercial papers cause thick folding spines and spring-back expansion that jam automated cartoning lines. We utilize specialized medical-grade thin-print paper (27 to 60 GSM) featuring exceptional mechanical tensile strength and high opacity that prevents ink show-through even with heavy typography.</p>\n<h3>2. Miniature Outsert Folding & Wafer Tab Sealing</h3>\n<p>Pre-folded miniature outserts sealed with clear fugitive adhesive wafer tabs ensure the leaflet remains flat and rigid. This allows robotic pick-and-place inserter carousels (such as GUK and Vijuk) to feed up to 350 leaflets per minute with zero double-feed errors.</p>\n<h3>3. 100% Optical Pharma-Code Vision Verification</h3>\n<p>To eliminate the catastrophic hazard of leaflet mix-ups between similar product dosages, our folding lines feature 100% inline optical sensors scanning miniature Pharma-Codes and 2D barcodes on every single fold pass. Any unmatched sheet is immediately rejected via high-speed pneumatic blowers.</p>', 'assets/images/prod_leaflets.jpg', 'Prescribing Leaflets & Miniature Outserts Engineering | Prince Art Packages', 'Technical guidelines on folding geometry, wafer seals, and 27-60 GSM medical papers for high-speed cartoning insertion.', '1', '2026-02-22 09:15:00', '2026-09-03 19:03:19'),
('5', 'Sustainable Secondary Packaging: Transitioning to ColdSeal Blister Wallets', 'sustainable-coldseal-blister-wallets', 'Why heat-free pressure bonding protects temperature-sensitive APIs and probiotics while cutting plastic packaging volume by up to 50% compared to rigid plastic clamshells.', '<h2>Heat-Free, Eco-Friendly Secondary Blister Packaging</h2>\n<p>Pharmaceutical manufacturers are under dual pressure: reducing single-use plastic packaging waste while protecting delicate active pharmaceutical ingredients (APIs) from thermal degradation. Traditional heat-sealed blister clamshells require high sealing temperatures (140°C to 180°C) that risk degrading live probiotic strains, peptides, and temperature-sensitive molecules.</p>\n<h3>1. The ColdSeal Advantage</h3>\n<p>ColdSeal Blister Wallets bond two coated paperboard layers utilizing cohesive pressure pinch-rollers without applying thermal heat. The drug cavity remains at room temperature throughout packaging, ensuring 100% API potency preservation.</p>\n<h3>2. 50% Plastic Reduction</h3>\n<p>By replacing heavy thermoformed plastic clamshells and vinyl packaging with certified FSC virgin paperboard, ColdSeal reduces plastic consumption by up to 50% while offering superior recyclable credentials.</p>\n<h3>3. Built-In Dose Adherence & Child-Resistance</h3>\n<p>ColdSeal wallets provide an expansive paperboard canvas for printed day-by-day calendar grids (7-day, 14-day, 28-day) that dramatically improve patient therapy adherence. Furthermore, child-resistant push-tab locking mechanisms can be integrated to meet ISO 8317 safety compliance.</p>', 'assets/images/coldseal.jpg', 'ColdSeal Blister Wallets: Sustainable Heat-Free Packaging | Prince Art Packages', 'Discover how ColdSeal pressure-sealed paperboard wallets protect heat-labile APIs and reduce plastic usage by 50%.', '1', '2026-02-25 14:20:00', '2026-09-03 19:03:19'),
('6', 'Small-Diameter Vial & Ampoule Labeling: Overcoming Flagging and Low-Temp Adhesion', 'small-diameter-vial-ampoule-labeling', 'Engineering self-adhesive roll labels with high initial tack, curve-conformable face-stocks, and deep-freeze (-80°C) adhesives for cold-chain biologics and injectables.', '<h2>Solving Curve Memory & Adhesion Challenges on Liquid Injectables</h2>\n<p>Labeling small-diameter pharmaceutical glass containers (such as 1ml–5ml ampoules, 2R–10R vaccine vials, and ophthalmic droppers) presents severe mechanical challenges. High face-stock stiffness causes label edges to spring open (known as \"label flagging\"), risking carton jams and lost regulatory batch identification.</p>\n<h3>1. Tight Curve-Conformable Face-Stocks</h3>\n<p>We formulate specialized semi-gloss papers and pliable polypropylene (BOPP) films with low bending stiffness and high flexibility. These materials wrap tightly around radii as small as 7 mm without memory rebound.</p>\n<h3>2. Deep-Freeze (-80°C) Cold-Chain Adhesives</h3>\n<p>Biological medications, mRNA therapies, and vaccines are stored in cryogenic and ultra-low temperature freezers (-20°C to -80°C). Our medical-grade acrylic adhesives maintain high cohesion and peel strength under deep-freeze conditions without crystallizing or peeling.</p>\n<h3>3. Inline Serialization Compatibility</h3>\n<p>All roll labels feature thermal-transfer and inkjet-receptive top-coatings engineered for non-smear 2D DataMatrix coding at high labeling machine speeds exceeding 400 containers per minute.</p>', 'assets/images/prod_labels.jpg', 'Small Diameter Vial & Ampoule Labeling Engineering | Prince Art Packages', 'Overcome label flagging and cold-chain delamination with engineered self-adhesive roll labels for vials, ampoules, and droppers.', '1', '2026-02-28 16:45:00', '2026-09-03 19:03:19'),
('7', 'Eliminating Transit Breakage in Glass Ampoules with Honeycomb Separators', 'eliminating-transit-breakage-glass-ampoules', 'A comparative impact analysis of engineered paperboard honeycomb cell grids vs EPS foam partitions in cleanroom packaging halls and export logistics.', '<h2>Protecting Fragile Liquid Parenterals During Multi-Modal Export</h2>\n<p>Sterile glass ampoules and liquid vials are exceptionally vulnerable to transit vibration shock, glass-to-glass scuffing, and hairline micro-fractures during road, rail, and sea shipping. Even a single broken ampoule can contaminate an entire master shipper carton with liquid and glass shards.</p>\n<h3>1. Multi-Axis Shock Absorption with Honeycomb Grid Cells</h3>\n<p>Prince Art Packages manufactures engineered paperboard honeycomb partitions and collapsible interlocking grid dividers. By encapsulating each container within its own structural cushioned cell (10, 20, 50, or 100-cell matrices), glass-to-glass contact is completely prevented.</p>\n<h3>2. Cleanroom Particulate Compatibility</h3>\n<p>Unlike expanded polystyrene (EPS) foam and cheap strawboards that shed static-charged dust particles inside clean packaging halls, our honeycomb partitions are manufactured from low-dust, solid bleached Kraftliner board conforming to cGMP air cleanliness standards.</p>\n<h3>3. Sustainable Export Compliance</h3>\n<p>Many international export destinations impose strict plastic packaging bans. Honeycomb paperboard separators are 100% biodegradable, recyclable, and compliant with FSC sustainable packaging standards.</p>', 'assets/images/prod_honeycomb.jpg', 'Glass Ampoule Protection & Honeycomb Dividers | Prince Art Packages', 'Prevent transit breakage and particle shedding in sterile injectables using engineered paperboard honeycomb separators.', '1', '2026-03-02 08:30:00', '2026-09-03 19:03:19');
